abstract: >-
  This project evaluates the performance of both commercial (GPT-4) and 
  open-source (Gemma, DeepSeek, Mistral) Large Language Models on Albanian 
  language tasks including translation, text summarization, and question 
  answering. We demonstrate that open-source models perform competitively 
  with commercial alternatives for low-resource language processing.
